values.content:
Generate an on-call handoff summary.

Outgoing: {{ $json.outgoingEngineer }}
Incoming: {{ $json.incomingEngineer }}
Shift period: {{ $json.shiftPeriod }}

Incidents this shift:
{{ $json.incidentsThisShift.map(i=>i.id+' ['+i.severity+']['+i.status+'] '+i.title+(i.notes?': '+i.notes:'')).join('\n') || 'none' }}

Watch items (things to keep an eye on):
{{ $json.watchItems.join('\n') || 'none flagged' }}

Planned maintenance: {{ $json.plannedMaintenance || 'none' }}
Deployments this shift: {{ $json.deploymentsThisShift || 'none' }}
System health notes: {{ $json.systemHealthNotes || 'none' }}
Open questions: {{ $json.openQuestions || 'none' }}

Return JSON:
{"handoff_summary":"2-3 sentences: overall shift summary and system state","overall_status":"quiet|normal|elevated_attention|active_concern","incidents_recap":[{"incident_id":"","what_happened":"","current_state":"resolved|monitoring|ongoing","action_needed_from_incoming":"specific action or null"}],"active_watch_items":[{"item":"","why_watching":"","what_would_trigger_action":"","priority":"high|medium|low"}],"system_state_summary":"brief honest assessment of overall system health going into the next shift","upcoming_events":["scheduled deployments, maintenance, or known risk windows in the upcoming shift"],"questions_for_incoming":["specific things the incoming engineer should confirm or investigate"],"quick_reference":{"anything_currently_paged_or_alerting":"specific status or none","recent_deploys_to_be_aware_of":""}}
